<title>UK: Royal &amp; Sun integration on track for 1998.</title>
<headline>Royal &amp; Sun integration on track for 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-merged UK composite insurer Royal &amp; Sun Alliance said on Thursday that it was on target to achieve full integration by 1998 and confirmed that it expects to see a reduction of 175 million stg in annual costs by then.</p>
</text>
